msgid "Nexus 平台图册"
msgstr "Nexus platform diagram atlas"

msgid "本图册保留15类必需视图、两张补充图与本轮 I/O 架构视图 FIG-16， 另加入 IO-24 的 FIG-17/18 目标图源、IO-36 的 FIG-21 Native 装配／生命周期图， 以及 IO-31 的 FIG-22 G474 命名 GPIO 状态／所有权图。FIG-23–26 依次描述 五项有界软件机制的所有权、U575 保留时钟与 Stop2 所有权及状态、 UART TX 复制代理的 kernel 所有权与退出、I3C 核心借用与整总线证明。 FIG-27 另述同一 Stop2 owner 的选定 SRAM4/LPDMA 有限复制及复合退出。主图登记见 {download}`图清单 <diagram-index.csv>`，维护规则见 [图示标准](../../design/documentation-standards.md)。图有精确current/reference/target身份， 不可从图源存在、渲染成功或软件流程推断硬件和外部发布已执行。"
msgstr "This gallery retains 15 required view types, two supplementary figures and the current I/O architecture view FIG-16, together with the IO-24 target diagram sources FIG-17/18, the IO-36 FIG-21 Native assembly/lifecycle diagram, and the IO-31 FIG-22 G474 named GPIO state/ownership diagram. FIG-23–26 respectively describe ownership of five bounded software mechanisms, U575 retained-clock and Stop2 ownership and state, kernel ownership and exit for the copied UART TX broker, and I3C core borrowing and whole-bus proofs. FIG-27 separately describes the same Stop2 owner's selected finite SRAM4/LPDMA copy and compound exit. See the {download}`figure index <diagram-index.csv>` for the main register and the [diagram standards](../../design/documentation-standards.md) for maintenance rules. Each figure has an explicit current/reference/target identity. The existence of diagram sources, successful rendering or a software workflow does not establish that hardware execution or external publication has occurred."

msgid "FIG-28 另述单组 LPTIM1 tuple 的选定 LPBAM 参考，以及同一 Stop2 owner 的有序最终访问证明。"
msgstr "FIG-28 adds the selected single-tuple LPTIM1 LPBAM reference and the ordered final-access proof of the same Stop2 owner."

msgid "原15类主图及两张补充图的代码依据保持`0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`。 FIG-16 描述 `c4249e98` 基线之后的 I/O 增量机制，其具体源码链接和执行状态见 [本轮架构说明](../../design/io-evolution.md)与42项台账，不能继承原候选资格。 文档工具的实际结果另见执行记录。图源为可编辑 DOT，输出为本地 SVG；标签、 线型和文字共同表达关系，不只依赖颜色。"
msgstr "The original 15 main views and two supplements retain code basis `0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`. FIG-16 describes I/O evolution after baseline `c4249e98`; [the iteration design](../../design/io-evolution.md) and 42-item ledger supply source links and execution status. It cannot inherit the earlier candidate qualification. Actual documentation-tool results remain in execution records. Editable DOT produces local SVG; labels, line styles and text express relationships together rather than relying on color alone."

msgid "当前每张图均提供中英文视图；新增 FIG-17/18 的渲染与审查须分别取得 实际记录。页面按所选语言使用本地SVG。节点、箭头、属性与 范围仍由同一canonical DOT维护；`labels.json`只维护完整标签译文，不能改变拓扑。 各语言DOT/SVG应与原图配对检查；缺失译文、陈旧输出和非法资源使门禁失败。 SVG采用Graphviz Cairo字形路径输出，使离线读者无需安装中文字体；每图附title、 desc和正文alt/caption。生成主机需要锁定Graphviz、Cairo及Noto Sans CJK SC， 最终工具身份与自动检查结果由文档交付记录绑定。源码语义、实际浏览器桌面/窄屏/ 放大/打印与离线包验收分开记录。原15主图和2补充图保留各自已完成的审查；新增 FIG-16/17/18 的内容、图示和翻译审查状态单独记录，不能从渲染成功推断。浏览器与正式包 验收另按实际执行记录判断，这些状态不建立 HIL 或公开部署资格。"
msgstr "Each current diagram has English and Chinese views. Rendering and review of the additional FIG-17/18 sources require separate actual records. Pages use local SVGs for the selected language. Nodes, arrows, attributes and scope remain maintained in one canonical DOT; `labels.json` contains complete label translations without changing topology. Language DOT/SVG pairs are checked against their source figures; missing translations, stale outputs or invalid resources fail the gate. SVGs use Graphviz Cairo glyph paths so offline readers do not need installed Chinese fonts; each figure has a title, desc and body alt/caption. The generation host requires locked Graphviz, Cairo and Noto Sans CJK SC. Documentation delivery records bind the actual tool identity and automated checks. Source semantics, actual browser desktop/narrow-screen/zoom/print checks and offline-package acceptance are recorded separately. The original 15 main figures and two supplementary figures retain their completed reviews; content, diagram and translation reviews for FIG-16/17/18 are recorded independently and cannot be inferred from successful rendering. Browser and formal-package acceptance follow their actual execution records; these states do not establish HIL or public deployment qualification."

msgid "修改标签后显式使用已准备的锁定工具生成语言视图，然后执行完整检查："
msgstr "After changing labels, explicitly use the prepared locked tools to generate language views, then run the complete check:"

msgid "`localized/en/`和`localized/zh_CN/`是派生资产。生成成功只证明渲染；标签语义、 真实浏览器和离线资源闭包分别审查，原图代码依据与历史执行身份保持不变。"
msgstr "`localized/en/` and `localized/zh_CN/` are derived assets. Successful generation proves rendering only. Label semantics, actual browser behavior and offline resource closure are reviewed separately; original diagram code references and historical execution identities remain unchanged."

msgid "FIG-01 全平台分层与外部边界"
msgstr "FIG-01 Whole-platform layers and external boundaries"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Products remain external; components and OS are optional; runtime access and build facts have distinct edges.**"

msgid "![FIG-01：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分](platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-01: Products remain external; components and OS are optional; runtime access and build facts have distinct edges.](platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-01：产品外置；可选组件与OS；运行访问和构建事实逐边区分"
msgstr "FIG-01: Products remain external; components and OS are optional; runtime access and build facts have distinct edges."

msgid "应用拥有任务、调度、恢复和停机协调。Board参与构建期授权；factory取得身份后日常I/O通过face进入provider。Arch按编译目标选择，没有CPU factory或强制OS转发。虚线为显式可选关系或构建期事实，实线标签说明调用/合同。"
msgstr "Applications own tasks, scheduling, recovery and shutdown coordination. Board contributes build-time authorization. After factory lookup obtains an identity, daily I/O enters the provider through its face. Arch is selected by the compiled target; there is no CPU factory or mandatory OS forwarding. Dashed edges denote explicit optional relationships or build-time facts; solid edge labels identify calls/contracts."

msgid "依据：[当前架构合同](../../delivery/architecture.md)、[根CMake](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt)、[静态装配生成](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py)、[平台运行补充图](platform-runtime.svg)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <platform-architecture.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-43。"
msgstr "Sources: [current architecture contract](../../delivery/architecture.md), [root CMake](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt), [static assembly generation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py), [runtime supplement](platform-runtime.svg).  {download}`editable DOT <platform-architecture.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-43."

