msgstr "FIG-02: H743 baremetal IRQ UART; exact PUBLIC/PRIVATE/INTERFACE/OBJECT relationships."

msgid "参考tools/configure/assemblies/nucleo-h743-baremetal-uart.toml的选定目标。箭头从依赖者指向被依赖目标；虚线明确PRIVATE include或OBJECT注入。统一warnings、配置选项边和GC策略省略；它们仍由真实CMake管理。厂商headers只进入实现/启动私有范围，配置生成的bindings也按私有include规则消费SDK；可选组件不在本装配中。"
msgstr "This reference selects the targets of tools/configure/assemblies/nucleo-h743-baremetal-uart.toml. Arrows run from the dependent to its dependency; dashed edges explicitly identify PRIVATE includes or OBJECT injection. Shared warnings, configuration-option edges and GC policy are omitted and remain managed by real CMake. Vendor headers enter only private implementation/startup scope; generated bindings also consume SDKs through private includes. Optional components are not selected in this assembly."

msgid "依据：[根目标图](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt)、[firmware helper](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake)、[IO targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/CMakeLists.txt)、[Arch targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/CMakeLists.txt)、[OS targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/CMakeLists.txt)、[H743 target](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/CMakeLists.txt)、[ABI/Config目标](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Options.cmake)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <build-targets.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-44。"
msgstr "Sources: [root target graph](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CMakeLists.txt), [firmware helper](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Firmware.cmake), [IO targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/CMakeLists.txt), [Arch targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/CMakeLists.txt), [OS targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/CMakeLists.txt), [H743 target](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/CMakeLists.txt), [ABI/Config targets](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Options.cmake).  {download}`editable DOT <build-targets.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-44."

