msgid "FIG-03：构建输入/产物链，生成失败使owned bundle失效"
msgstr "FIG-03: Build-input/artifact chain; generation failure invalidates the owned bundle."

msgid "边表示构建时输入和产物传递，不表示运行时调用。严格解析不能修复非法字段、冲突或陈旧输入；失败只撤回拥有的输出，不清理未拥有目录，也不暴露半成品。ELF/资源报告不构成实板资格。"
msgstr "Edges represent build-time input and artifact flow, not runtime calls. Strict parsing cannot repair invalid fields, conflicts or stale inputs. Failure withdraws only owned outputs: it neither clears unowned directories nor exposes partial artifacts. ELF/resource reports do not establish physical-board qualification."

msgid "依据：[配置器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/configure.py)、[不可变IR](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/ir.py)、[bundle事务](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bundle.py)、[构建合同](../../design/build-system.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <configuration-generation.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-45。"
