msgid "FIG-04 factory与静态实例"
msgstr "FIG-04 Factory and static instances"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Illustrative two selected instances of one class; same-mode ops are shared; controller/endpoint identities remain separate.**"

msgid "![FIG-04：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立](factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-04: Illustrative two selected instances of one class; same-mode ops are shared; controller/endpoint identities remain separate.](factory-instances.svg)"

msgid "FIG-04：按需选入的两同类实例示意；同模式ops共享，controller/endpoint独立"
msgstr "FIG-04: Illustrative two selected instances of one class; same-mode ops are shared; controller/endpoint identities remain separate."

msgid "结构图展示由生成器支持的按配置实例布局，不声称每块PCB均授权这些组合。同provider同模式实例共享readonly ops，各自context/state/storage独立。不同provider或模式可使用不同ops；调用方法接收本次context。controller和endpoint有独立factory命名空间，endpoint不冒充控制器。ID只在当前assembly有效，默认uint16_t typedef不提供语言级跨类防混用。"
msgstr "The structure shows configuration-selected layouts supported by the generator; it does not claim every PCB authorizes those combinations. Same-provider, same-mode instances share read-only ops while each context/state/storage remains independent. Different providers or modes can have different ops; a method receives the current context. Controllers and endpoints have distinct factory namespaces, and an endpoint cannot impersonate its controller. IDs are valid only in the current assembly; the default uint16_t typedef does not provide language-level protection against mixing classes."

msgid "依据：[typed factory生成](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/factory.py)、[face/state装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py)、[SPI公开接口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi.h)、[Native provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/native/bindings.py)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <factory-instances.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-46。"
msgstr "Sources: [typed factory generation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/factory.py), [face/state assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py), [public SPI interface](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi.h), [Native provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/native/bindings.py).  {download}`editable DOT <factory-instances.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-46."

msgid "FIG-05 显式启动停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "FIG-05 Explicit start, stop and failure cleanup"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains its own private startup/cleanup contract.**"

msgid "![FIG-05：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同](platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-05: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains its own private startup/cleanup contract.](platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-05：生成生命周期骨架；每个SoC私有启动/清理保持具体合同"
msgstr "FIG-05: Generated lifecycle skeleton; each SoC retains its own private startup/cleanup contract."

msgid "外部唯一执行者串行调用start/stop。start不启动调度器；失败的primary、cleanup、remaining_effects分别保留。已取得效果者参与逆序cleanup，停止可能先成功释放部分实例再返回BUSY/IO。不能把BUSY视为仍然完整运行，也不能因timeout回收存储。具体start_system失败可能在其私有路径中完成清理或保留失败阶段，重试必须满足该provider合同，不能把图视为统一恢复API。"
msgstr "One external executor serializes start/stop. start does not start a scheduler; failures retain primary, cleanup and remaining_effects separately. Owners of acquired effects participate in reverse-order cleanup. Stop can release some instances successfully before returning BUSY/IO. BUSY cannot imply the platform is still fully running, and timeout does not permit storage reclamation. A concrete start_system failure may clean up inside its private path or retain the failed phase. Retry must satisfy that provider contract; the diagram is not a universal recovery API."

msgid "依据：[生成的start/stop](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py)、[GPIO冷租约](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py)、[H743冷生命周期](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)、[当前平台合同](../../delivery/architecture.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <platform-lifecycle.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-47。"
msgstr "Sources: [generated start/stop](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/bindings.py), [cold GPIO lease](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py), [H743 cold lifecycle](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), [current platform contract](../../delivery/architecture.md).  {download}`editable DOT <platform-lifecycle.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-47."

msgid "FIG-06 Core请求状态与借用"
msgstr "FIG-06 Core request states and borrows"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core helpers; no promise of a recovery API for every provider.**"

msgid "![FIG-06：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API](request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-06: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core helpers; no promise of a recovery API for every provider.](request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-06：Core helper允许的迁移与调用前提；不承诺各provider恢复API"
msgstr "FIG-06: Transitions and preconditions allowed by Core helpers; no promise of a recovery API for every provider."

msgid "REJECTED/ACCEPTED是admission结果而非request状态。ACCEPTED后保持request/buffer借用，cancel/deadline只启动终止进度。provider先排空全部必要引用，再以release发布SETTLED作为对request的最后一次访问；调用方以acquire观察。相关adapter/observer另需退出。QUARANTINED到SETTLED仅在实际恢复和排空证明成立时合法，不能通过initialize强行重置借用对象。"
msgstr "REJECTED/ACCEPTED are admission results, not request states. After ACCEPTED, request/buffer borrowing continues; cancel/deadline only starts termination progress. The provider first drains every required reference, then release-publishes SETTLED as its final request access; the caller observes with acquire semantics. Related adapters/observers must exit separately. QUARANTINED to SETTLED is legal only after actual recovery and proof of drain. initialize cannot forcibly reset a borrowed object."

msgid "依据：[request公开合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/request.h)、[实际Core迁移](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/src/request.c)、[owner最终发布](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/src/bus_owner.c)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <request-lifecycle.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-48。"
msgstr "Sources: [public request contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/request.h), [actual Core transitions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/src/request.c), [final owner publication](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/src/bus_owner.c).  {download}`editable DOT <request-lifecycle.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-48."

msgid "FIG-07 UART与SPI有限DMA时序"
msgstr "FIG-07 Finite UART and SPI DMA timing"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：F407 USART1/SPI1精确有限DMA；Task/IRQ/DMA完成与失败路径。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Exact finite F407 USART1/SPI1 DMA; Task/IRQ/DMA completion and failure paths.**"

msgid "![FIG-07：F407 USART1/SPI1精确有限DMA；Task/IRQ/DMA完成与失败路径](dma-completion.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-07: Exact finite F407 USART1/SPI1 DMA; Task/IRQ/DMA completion and failure paths.](dma-completion.svg)"

msgid "FIG-07：F407 USART1/SPI1精确有限DMA；Task/IRQ/DMA完成与失败路径"
msgstr "FIG-07: Exact finite F407 USART1/SPI1 DMA; Task/IRQ/DMA completion and failure paths."

msgid "上到下为先后，并区分Task、DMA IRQ和UART IRQ。UART DMA TC不替代最后串行位的TC；SPI两个DMA完成不替代BSY=0/TXE=1。最终排空与错误观察、引用撤回都先于SETTLED。CS节点描述软件命令，未证明电气电平或物理时序。取消/错误分支仍需同样的实际排空条件；失败保持QUARANTINED借用。不把NDTR推导为可靠wire字节数，也不推广为GD32 reset语义。"
msgstr "Top-to-bottom order distinguishes Task, DMA IRQ and UART IRQ. UART DMA TC cannot replace TC for the final serial bit; completion of both SPI DMA streams cannot replace BSY=0/TXE=1. Final drain, error observation and reference withdrawal all precede SETTLED. CS nodes describe software commands and do not prove electrical levels or physical timing. Cancel/error paths require the same actual drain conditions; failure retains QUARANTINED borrowing. NDTR is not a reliable wire-byte count, and this view does not extend to GD32 reset semantics."

msgid "依据：[F407 UART DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/uart_dma.c)、[F407 SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/spi_dma.c)、[DMA排空合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/dma.h)、[多控制器合同](../../design/multiple-dma-controllers.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <dma-completion.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-49。"
msgstr "Sources: [F407 UART DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/uart_dma.c), [F407 SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/spi_dma.c), [DMA drain contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/dma.h), [multiple-controller contract](../../design/multiple-dma-controllers.md).  {download}`editable DOT <dma-completion.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-49."

msgid "FIG-08 wait wake与外部退出"
msgstr "FIG-08 Wait, wake and externally owned shutdown"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual execution/join responsibilities.**"

msgid "![FIG-08：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任](wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-08: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual execution/join responsibilities.](wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

msgid "FIG-08：ready-arm-ready-wait-ready与实际执行/join责任"
msgstr "FIG-08: ready-arm-ready-wait-ready and actual execution/join responsibilities."

msgid "nx_wait_until只检查谓词并等待提示，不service硬件或创建worker。arm后再次检查避免lost wake；TIMEOUT后最终谓词为true仍返回SUCCESS。通知端口要求单一waiter。外部shutdown先关闭admission并请求cancel，保持owner/IRQ推进drain。producer借用结清后join；确认owner idle包含publication退出，再结束并join执行者。随后停止硬件RX/IRQ publishers、detach wake并join其他发布者，最后销毁OS同步存储。相关observers最终访问另需退出；仍运行的内核不得提前撤回clock/Tick，失败存储继续保留。"
msgstr "nx_wait_until only checks a predicate and waits for hints; it neither services hardware nor creates a worker. Rechecking after arm prevents a lost wake. After TIMEOUT, a final true predicate still returns SUCCESS. The notification port requires one waiter. External shutdown first closes admission and requests cancel while keeping owner/IRQ drain progress alive. Join producers after their loans settle; confirm owner idle includes publication exit, then stop and join the executor. Next stop hardware RX/IRQ publishers, detach wake and join other publishers; only then destroy OS synchronization storage. Related observers need their final access to exit independently. A running kernel must retain its clock/Tick, and failed storage remains retained."

msgid "依据：[wait合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/wait.h)、[生产wait算法](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/wait.c)、[owner接口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/bus_owner.h)、[OS生命周期](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/README.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <wait-wake-shutdown.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-50。"
msgstr "Sources: [wait contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/include/nexus/os/wait.h), [production wait algorithm](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/wait.c), [owner interface](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/bus_owner.h), [OS lifecycle](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/README.md).  {download}`editable DOT <wait-wake-shutdown.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-50."

msgid "FIG-09 H743内存DMA与Cache"
msgstr "FIG-09 H743 memory, DMA and cache"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte AXI SRAM lines.**"

msgid "![FIG-09：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines](h743-memory-cache.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-09: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte AXI SRAM lines.](h743-memory-cache.svg)"

msgid "FIG-09：H743ZIT6有限USART3 TX；AXI SRAM完整32-byte lines"
msgstr "FIG-09: Finite H743ZIT6 USART3 TX; complete 32-byte AXI SRAM lines."

msgid "选定TX DMA仅授权AXI SRAM 512 KiB；其他物理域和dma_engines可达事实不自动授权placement或供电。Cache-on要求完整32-byte lines独占，最大65504 bytes；Cache-off接受1..65535 bytes。PREPARING借用先成立，clean在调用方正常mask下进行，完成前不能取消回收。图不实现或声明H743 RX DMA；未来RX需要独立前置及排空后维护合同。可信复位或此前成功自有clean/disable才建立冷cache前提，CCR关闭位不能认领外国dirty状态。"
msgstr "Selected TX DMA authorizes only 512 KiB AXI SRAM; other physical domains and dma_engines reachability facts do not automatically authorize placement or power. Cache-on requires exclusive complete 32-byte lines, with a maximum of 65504 bytes; Cache-off accepts 1..65535 bytes. PREPARING establishes the borrow first; clean executes under the caller’s normal masks, and cancellation cannot reclaim storage before it finishes. This diagram neither implements nor claims H743 RX DMA; future RX needs separate pre- and post-drain maintenance contracts. Trusted reset or a prior successful owned clean/disable establishes cold caches; clear CCR bits cannot claim responsibility for foreign dirty state."

msgid "依据：[精确物理域](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/soc.json)、[H743 provider范围](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)、[TX DMA实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/uart_dma.c)、[cache范围合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache.h)、[冷cache合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache_control.h)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <h743-memory-cache.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-51。"
msgstr "Sources: [exact physical domains](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/soc.json), [H743 provider scope](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), [TX DMA implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/uart_dma.c), [cache range contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache.h), [cold-cache contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/cache_control.h).  {download}`editable DOT <h743-memory-cache.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-51."

msgid "FIG-10 Source SDK独立消费"
msgstr "FIG-10 Independent Source SDK consumption"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：实际公开入口和consumer；搬移完整prefix，Native run/ARM link分开。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Actual public entry points and consumers; relocate the complete prefix; Native execution and ARM linking remain separate.**"

msgid "![FIG-10：实际公开入口和consumer；搬移完整prefix，Native run/ARM link分开](source-sdk-consumer.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-10: Actual public entry points and consumers; relocate the complete prefix; Native execution and ARM linking remain separate.](source-sdk-consumer.svg)"

msgid "FIG-10：实际公开入口和consumer；搬移完整prefix，Native run/ARM link分开"
msgstr "FIG-10: Actual public entry points and consumers; relocate the complete prefix; Native execution and ARM linking remain separate."

msgid "打包、搬移、verify与consumer执行是独立步骤。安装prefix必须整体移动，SDK子树不能单独替代包闭包。find_package与resolver边界读取实际字节身份，fixture opt-in不绕过checksum。Native consumer实际运行；MCU consumer建立编译/链接/资源证据，不声明上板执行。parent target不得受到平台宏或厂商include污染。"
msgstr "Packaging, relocation, verify and consumer execution are separate steps. Move the complete installed prefix; an SDK subtree cannot replace package closure. find_package and resolver boundaries read actual byte identities; fixture opt-in does not bypass checksums. Native consumers actually run; MCU consumers establish compile/link/resource evidence, not physical execution. Platform macros or vendor includes must not contaminate parent targets."

msgid "依据：[Source SDK打包与verify](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py)、[真实独立consumers](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verify_consumers.py)、[resolver SDK验证边界](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/sdk.py)、[CMake SDK入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/SDK.cmake)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <source-sdk-consumer.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-52。"
msgstr "Sources: [Source SDK packaging and verify](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py), [real independent consumers](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verify_consumers.py), [resolver SDK verification boundary](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/sdk.py), [CMake SDK entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/SDK.cmake).  {download}`editable DOT <source-sdk-consumer.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-52."

msgid "FIG-11 软件与HIL证据关系"
msgstr "FIG-11 Software and HIL evidence relationships"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：实际scope evidence独立取得；HIL tooling不是物理测量。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Each scope obtains actual evidence separately; HIL tooling is not a physical measurement.**"

msgid "![FIG-11：实际scope evidence独立取得；HIL tooling不是物理测量](qualification-evidence.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-11: Each scope obtains actual evidence separately; HIL tooling is not a physical measurement.](qualification-evidence.svg)"

msgid "FIG-11：实际scope evidence独立取得；HIL tooling不是物理测量"
msgstr "FIG-11: Each scope obtains actual evidence separately; HIL tooling is not a physical measurement."

msgid "Host/model、ARM/link/resources、SDK消费、两次断网复现和HIL工装各自必须有实际执行记录，并绑定同source/config/artifact。候选封存重新验证scope proof和原始字节。实际station测量另外绑定PCB、silicon、fixture及同镜像；无设备为not_executed。软件候选不自动提升为产品release、安全认证或LTS。"
msgstr "Host/model, ARM/link/resources, SDK consumption, two network-disabled reproductions and HIL tooling each need actual execution records bound to the same source/config/artifact. Candidate sealing revalidates scope proofs and raw bytes. Physical station measurements additionally bind PCB, silicon, fixture and the same image; absent equipment means not_executed. A software candidate does not automatically become a product release, safety certification or LTS promise."

msgid "依据：[资格合同](../../delivery/qualification.md)、[candidate scope校验](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/candidate.py)、[真实proof验证](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/proof.py)、[断网复现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/reproduce.py)、[HIL工装](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/README.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <qualification-evidence.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-53。"
msgstr "Sources: [qualification contract](../../delivery/qualification.md), [candidate scope validation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/candidate.py), [actual proof verification](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/proof.py), [network-disabled reproduction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/reproduce.py), [HIL tooling](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/README.md).  {download}`editable DOT <qualification-evidence.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-53."

msgid "FIG-12 文档SDK与证据发布恢复"
msgstr "FIG-12 Documentation, SDK and evidence publication and restore"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：交付流程参考；公开发布/下载需真实receipt，不从流程图推断发生。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Reference delivery flow; public publishing/downloading requires actual receipts and cannot be inferred from a diagram.**"

msgid "![FIG-12：交付流程参考；公开发布/下载需真实receipt，不从流程图推断发生](release-recovery.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-12: Reference delivery flow; public publishing/downloading requires actual receipts and cannot be inferred from a diagram.](release-recovery.svg)"

msgid "FIG-12：交付流程参考；公开发布/下载需真实receipt，不从流程图推断发生"
msgstr "FIG-12: Reference delivery flow; public publishing/downloading requires actual receipts and cannot be inferred from a diagram."

msgid "文档、SDK、软件候选保持独立payload与资格。manifest的outputs只列payload，不含自身/checksums/archive；archive hash由外层receipt记录。不可变release-id不覆盖旧目录，stable不表达全部HIL通过。SDK/candidate/evidence使用现有字节验证与恢复机制，文档发布工具按实际CLI结果验收。独立恢复检查路径、size、hash与适用consumer，不把归档成功视为重新执行全部历史tests。公开发布、下载、长期存储由真实外部receipt证明，流程存在不能替代。"
msgstr "Documentation, SDKs and software candidates retain separate payloads and qualification. Manifest outputs list only payload, excluding the manifest itself, checksums and archive; an outer receipt records the archive hash. An immutable release-id cannot overwrite old directories, and stable does not mean all HIL passed. SDK/candidate/evidence use existing byte verification and restore mechanisms; documentation publication tools are accepted through actual CLI results. Independent restore checks paths, sizes, hashes and applicable consumers. Archiving does not rerun all historical tests. Actual external receipts prove public publishing, downloading and long-term storage; a workflow cannot replace them."

msgid "依据：[文档实际封存与恢复](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/documentation/delivery.py)、[文档交付合同](../../design/documentation-system.md)、[Source SDK闭包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py)、[候选封存](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/candidate.py)、[scope proof](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/proof.py)、[归档与独立恢复](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/store.py)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <release-recovery.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-54。"
msgstr "Sources: [actual documentation sealing and restore](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/documentation/delivery.py), [documentation delivery contract](../../design/documentation-system.md), [Source SDK closure](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py), [candidate sealing](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/candidate.py), [scope proof](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/proof.py), [archive and independent restore](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/evidence/store.py).  {download}`editable DOT <release-recovery.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-54."

msgid "FIG-13 Cortex-M能力分层"
msgstr "FIG-13 Cortex-M capability layers"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：九核CPU软件层、Runtime、真实SoC与实板范围分开。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Nine-core CPU software, Runtime, concrete SoC and physical-board scopes remain separate.**"

msgid "![FIG-13：九核CPU软件层、Runtime、真实SoC与实板范围分开](cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-13: Nine-core CPU software, Runtime, concrete SoC and physical-board scopes remain separate.](cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"

msgid "FIG-13：九核CPU软件层、Runtime、真实SoC与实板范围分开"
msgstr "FIG-13: Nine-core CPU software, Runtime, concrete SoC and physical-board scopes remain separate."

msgid "CpuProfileIR显式选择合法ABI和optional feature，不从内核名推导能力。Runtime没有SoC/Board/startup/linker/factory；整平台另需精确provider和资源。当前M7冷cache控制不推广至其他带cache内核。图中的软件gates表示必须实际取得范围内证据，不继承历史counts；真实context保存、coherence、特权和波形仍需物理验收。"
msgstr "CpuProfileIR explicitly selects legal ABI and optional features; capabilities are not inferred from the core name. Runtime has no SoC/Board/startup/linker/factory; a whole platform additionally needs exact providers and resources. Current M7 cold-cache control does not extend to other cache-equipped cores. Software gates in the view require actual evidence within their own scope and cannot inherit historical counts. Real context preservation, coherency, privilege and waveforms still need physical acceptance."

msgid "依据：[九核软件合同](../../delivery/cortex-m.md)、[CPU解析器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/cpu.py)、[Runtime CMake入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Runtime.cmake)、[Arch源码目标](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/CMakeLists.txt)、[整平台支持范围](../../delivery/support.md)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <cortex-m-capabilities.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-55。"
msgstr "Sources: [nine-core software contract](../../delivery/cortex-m.md), [CPU resolver](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/cpu.py), [Runtime CMake entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/platform/Runtime.cmake), [Arch source target](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/CMakeLists.txt), [whole-platform support scope](../../delivery/support.md).  {download}`editable DOT <cortex-m-capabilities.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-55."

msgid "FIG-14 U575同步双域参考"
msgstr "FIG-14 U575 synchronous dual-domain reference"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS; the default TZEN0 provider is unchanged.**"

msgid "![FIG-14：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider](u575-security-domains.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-14: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS; the default TZEN0 provider is unchanged.](u575-security-domains.svg)"

msgid "FIG-14：独立TZEN1无OS同步GPIO；不改变TZEN0默认provider"
msgstr "FIG-14: Independent TZEN1 synchronous GPIO without OS; the default TZEN0 provider is unchanged."

msgid "boot owner供给并在执行前建立实际option-byte/镜像布局前提，机制不写option bytes。GTZC/SAU/NS MPU是不同边界，NSC fetch检查Secure MPU，不能用CMSE观察替代bus firewall或pin。参考要求无NS handlers、RTOS和自主masters，固定world principal只允许同步scalar GPIO。取得不可逆效果后的失败只能保留到reset；SG的同步pin来自静态映射和无并发条件。实际8/16 MPU region观测仅属于此参考，不修改TZEN0 provider的exact-eight tuple。全部物理隔离尚未执行。"
msgstr "The boot owner supplies and establishes actual option-byte/image-layout preconditions before execution; the mechanism does not write option bytes. GTZC, SAU and NS MPU are distinct boundaries. NSC fetch checks Secure MPU; CMSE observation cannot replace a bus firewall or pinning. This reference requires no NS handlers, RTOS or autonomous masters; its fixed world principal permits only synchronous scalar GPIO. Failure after acquiring irreversible effects must be retained until reset. Synchronous SG pinning derives from static mappings and absence of concurrency. Actual observations of 8/16 MPU regions apply only to this reference and do not alter the exact-eight tuple of the TZEN0 provider. All physical isolation cases remain unexecuted."

msgid "依据：[双域权威合同](../../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md)、[生产冷owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/security.c)、[真实配对镜像fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/u575_trustzone)、[UserIoBroker](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/README.md)、[CMSE公开观察合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/nonsecure.h)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <u575-security-domains.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-56。"
msgstr "Sources: [canonical dual-domain contract](../../design/u575-trustzone-contract.md), [production cold owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/security.c), [actual paired-image fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/u575_trustzone), [UserIoBroker](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/README.md), [public CMSE observation contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/arch/include/nexus/arch/nonsecure.h).  {download}`editable DOT <u575-security-domains.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-56."

msgid "FIG-15 连续RX与可见丢块"
msgstr "FIG-15 Continuous RX and observable block loss"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO loans, loss and stop responsibilities.**"

msgid "![FIG-15：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任](continuous-stream.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-15: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO loans, loss and stop responsibilities.](continuous-stream.svg)"

msgid "FIG-15：F407 USART1连续RX；预置FIFO贷款、loss和停止责任"
msgstr "FIG-15: Continuous F407 USART1 RX; preposted FIFO loans, loss and stop responsibilities."

msgid "preposted producer和普通producer不得混用。旧块在两个hardware targets中完全消失并证明CT/EN/新flags后才能FIFO发布；失败撤源并LIFO撤未来贷款，BORROWED consumer块不被覆盖。缺spare、IDLE和恢复可有间隙，lost_blocks是已观察边界而非精确遗漏wire字节。TC标志不能数任意多次合并回绕，实际IRQ/换址延迟必须小于一块fill时间。stop关闭admission、保持drain，outstanding=0后仍需调用者/observer退出。ADC首发trigger blocks由service显式rearm且有块间间隙，本图不声称连续ADC。"
msgstr "Do not mix preposted and ordinary producers. Publish an old block in FIFO order only after it disappears completely from both hardware targets and CT/EN/new flags prove withdrawal. On failure, withdraw sources and release future loans in LIFO order; BORROWED consumer blocks must not be overwritten. Missing spare blocks, IDLE and recovery can cause gaps. lost_blocks counts observed boundaries, not exact missing wire bytes. A TC flag cannot count arbitrary coalesced wraps; actual IRQ/address-replacement latency must be shorter than one block fill time. stop closes admission and preserves drain. outstanding=0 still requires caller/observer exit. First-release ADC trigger blocks are explicitly rearmed by service and have gaps between blocks; this view does not claim continuous ADC."

msgid "依据：[UART DMA/连续贷款合同](../../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)、[stream状态合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/stream.h)、[容量与观察合同](../../design/io-observation-recovery.md)、[F407 RX DMA实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/uart_receive.c)、[ADC显式rearm](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/adc_stream.c)。 {download}`可编辑DOT <continuous-stream.dot>`；实施关联：DOC-57。"
msgstr "Sources: [UART DMA/continuous-loan contract](../../design/uart-dma-rs485.md), [stream state contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/stream.h), [capacity and observation contract](../../design/io-observation-recovery.md), [F407 RX DMA implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/uart_receive.c), [explicit ADC rearm](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/drivers/adc_stream.c).  {download}`editable DOT <continuous-stream.dot>`; Implementation item: DOC-57."

msgid "FIG-16 当前 I/O 装配与执行"
msgstr "FIG-16 Current I/O assembly and execution"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：本轮软件机制；精确模式与验证状态由 IO-01–42 台账维护。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current. Scope: Software mechanisms in this iteration; IO-01–42 owns exact mode and validation status.**"

msgid "![FIG-16：构建期资源计划、静态 factory 与运行调用分别标记；可选机制不建立硬件资格](io-evolution.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-16: Distinct build-time resource plans, static factory and runtime calls; optional mechanisms do not establish hardware qualification](io-evolution.svg)"

msgid "FIG-16：构建期资源计划、静态 factory 与运行调用分别标记；可选机制不建立硬件资格"
msgstr "FIG-16: Distinct build-time resource plans, static factory and runtime calls; optional mechanisms do not establish hardware qualification"

msgid "上部箭头表达 authored TOML、SoC/Board 事实、typed IR、原子 bundle 与 CMake 的 构建关系；下部箭头表达查找、调用和复制观测。factory 只返回既有引用，日常 I/O 通过 face 直接进入 provider。硅片准入、traits 和时间戳辅助均显式可选；准入结果 不自动启动硬件，checked service 不证明请求已经结束。应用拥有执行推进与停机。"
msgstr "Upper arrows express build relationships among authored TOML, SoC/Board facts, typed IR, the atomic bundle and CMake. Lower arrows express lookup, calls and copied observations. Factory lookup only returns existing references; ordinary I/O reaches providers directly through a face. Silicon admission, traits and timestamp helpers are explicitly optional. Admission does not automatically start hardware, and checked service does not prove request completion. The application owns progress and shutdown."

msgid "可选 USB EP0 packetizer 沿同一显式调用路径组合包层 face：应用拥有 outer request， 调用者提供 adapter 存储，组件维护两个固定 inner packet 槽；provider 保留已准入 包的临时借用。ROM profile 只是生成的只读选定事实。inner DATA ACK、outer STATUS ACK 与地址提交分别观察， 借用不随 epoch 更新或取消而撤销；OUT0 恢复需外部 controller owner 授权。 本图不展开 USB 协议阶段，精确边界见 [USB FS device 合同](../../design/usb-device.md)。"
msgstr "The optional USB EP0 packetizer composes packet-layer faces along the same explicit call path: the application owns the outer request, the caller supplies adapter storage, and the component maintains two fixed inner packet slots; the provider retains a temporary borrow for each admitted packet. The ROM profile contains only generated read-only selected facts. Inner DATA ACK, outer STATUS ACK and address commit are observed separately; epoch changes or cancellation do not revoke borrows, and OUT0 recovery requires authorization by the external controller owner. This diagram does not expand the USB protocol phases; see the [USB FS device contract](../../design/usb-device.md) for the exact boundaries."

msgid "依据：[本轮 I/O 架构](../../design/io-evolution.md)、 [typed IR](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/ir.py)、 [选定 traits](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/io_traits.py)、 [硅片准入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/silicon.h)、 [观测合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT <io-evolution.dot>`；实施关联：IO-01/02/03/09/11/12/21。"
msgstr "Sources: [I/O evolution design](../../design/io-evolution.md), [typed IR](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/ir.py), [selected traits](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/io_traits.py), [silicon admission](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/silicon.h), [observation contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h). {download}`Editable DOT <io-evolution.dot>`; implementation references: IO-01/02/03/09/11/12/21."

msgid "FIG-17 H743 Flash RAM 边界目标设计"
msgstr "FIG-17 Target H743 Flash RAM boundary design"

msgid "**身份：target。范围：仅选定 STM32H743ZIT6 V 修订／三个 Cache-off 配置； 选定的显式操作数及汇编协议证明已实现，IO-24 原始完整退出与候选资格仍开放，实板 HIL 未执行。**"
msgstr "**Identity: target. Scope: selected STM32H743ZIT6 V / three Cache-off profiles only; selected explicit-operand and assembly protocol proofs are implemented. The original complete IO-24 exit and candidate qualification remain open; physical HIL is not executed.**"

msgid "![FIG-17 target：单一固定 workspace owner；汇编入口保护捕获值，C RAM 阶段与独立汇编返回门分工明确](h743-flash-ram-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-17 target: one owner with a fixed workspace; assembly entry protects captures; the C RAM phase and independent assembly return gate have distinct responsibilities](h743-flash-ram-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-17 target：单一固定 workspace owner；汇编入口保护捕获值，C RAM 阶段与独立汇编返回门分工明确"
msgstr "FIG-17 target: one owner with a fixed workspace; assembly entry protects captures; the C RAM phase and independent assembly return gate have distinct responsibilities"

msgid "构建边表达单份 TOML 经不可变 IR 选入生命周期与 face；factory 仅返回既有不可变 face， 显式 Platform start／stop 负责准备及保留失败清理。普通 provider 验证固定物理绑定； 单一生成 workspace 保存命令、诊断与 selector 效果账本。汇编入口保存调用者 CPU 状态， 在 r8-r11 中独立保护 MPU 捕获值，然后以私有 MSP 调用 C RAM 阶段。C 阶段发布私有 VTOR， 安装 guard，发出最多一次脉冲，真实排空并恢复 MPU；独立汇编返回门核对硬件与受保护捕获值， 恢复链接器确定的 VTOR 并证明读回后，汇编桥才恢复调用者 CPU 状态。guard 只约束 CPU； 其他 bus master 的撤回／join、调用者栈预留及恢复策略仍由外部调用者按合同保证。"
msgstr "Build edges show one TOML and immutable IR selecting lifecycle and face objects. The factory returns an existing immutable face; explicit Platform start/stop prepares bytes and retains failed cleanup. Ordinary provider admission validates the fixed physical binding. One generated workspace holds the command, diagnostics and selector-effect ledger. Assembly entry saves caller CPU state and independently protects MPU captures in r8-r11 before calling the C RAM phase on private MSP. The C phase publishes private VTOR, installs the guard, issues at most one pulse, actually drains both banks and restores MPU. The independent assembly return gate checks hardware against protected captures, restores linker-known VTOR and proves readback; only then does the assembly bridge restore caller CPU state. The guard constrains the CPU only. The external caller must still satisfy the contract for other bus-master withdrawal/join, caller-stack reserve and recovery policy."

msgid "目标依据：[RAM 维护目标合同](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md)、 [既有 H743 provider 范围](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)、 {download}`IO-24 原始退出条件 <../../design/io-evolution-execution.csv>`。 {download}`可编辑 DOT <h743-flash-ram-architecture.dot>`。图的渲染、独立语义审查与双语输出检查 只建立各自范围的文档证据；软件候选与实板资格仍分别判断。"
msgstr "Target basis: [RAM maintenance target contract](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md), [existing H743 provider scope](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), and {download}`Original IO-24 exit conditions <../../design/io-evolution-execution.csv>`. {download}`Editable DOT <h743-flash-ram-architecture.dot>`. Rendering, independent semantic review and bilingual-output checks establish documentation evidence within their respective scopes. Software-candidate and physical qualification remain separate judgments."

msgid "FIG-18 RAM 维护结清目标设计"
msgstr "FIG-18 Target RAM maintenance settlement design"

msgid "**身份：target。范围：选定 V 修订／Cache off 的同步物理脉冲；这是协议阶段， 不新增公共 request enum，不证明有界返回时间。**"
msgstr "**Identity: target. Scope: selected V/cache-off synchronous physical pulse; these are protocol stages, not a new public request enum or a bounded return-time proof.**"

msgid "![FIG-18 target：所有返回的 C RAM 路径汇入独立汇编门；超时保留责任，永久 busy 或无法证明恢复均无返回](h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-18 target: every returning C RAM path converges on the independent assembly gate; timeout retains responsibility; permanent busy or unproved restoration cannot return](h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-18 target：所有返回的 C RAM 路径汇入独立汇编门；超时保留责任，永久 busy 或无法证明恢复均无返回"
msgstr "FIG-18 target: every returning C RAM path converges on the independent assembly gate; timeout retains responsibility; permanent busy or unproved restoration cannot return"

msgid "每条边表示有条件的控制流。汇编入口、C 阶段及汇编返回门共用一份内嵌 selector 效果账本： 写 RNR 前登记，精确恢复并读回后清除；独立 MPU 捕获值保存在 r8-r11，C 阶段不得改写。 触发前已有临时效果的拒绝必须先证明回退；触发后 TIMEOUT 只锁存结果，不撤销脉冲，也不返回 Flash handler。C 阶段在有效 TIM2 epoch 下真实排空双 Bank，证明 LOCK 并恢复 MPU，仍保留 私有 VTOR 与私有 MSP。所有返回的 C 路径都必须经过独立汇编门：读回双 Bank 空闲、 零保留效果、精确保存的目标控制值与 LOCK，并对照受保护捕获值证明 MPU；随后恢复 链接器确定的 g_pfnVectors，执行屏障并证明 VTOR 读回。只有此后汇编桥才恢复 CPU 并返回。 永久 busy 持续留在 RAM 排空环；捕获、清理或返回条件无法证明则进入不返回 RAM 终止路径， 不暗示自动复位或喂狗。"
msgstr "Each edge is guarded control flow. Assembly entry, the C phase and the assembly return gate share one embedded selector-effect ledger: record before an RNR write; clear only after exact restoration and readback. Independent MPU captures stay in r8-r11, which the C phase must not modify. Pre-trigger rejection after temporary effects must first prove rollback. After trigger, TIMEOUT latches a result; it neither cancels the pulse nor returns to a Flash handler. The C phase actually drains both banks under a valid TIM2 epoch, proves LOCK and restores MPU while retaining private VTOR and private MSP. Every returning C path must pass the independent assembly gate: read back both-bank idle, zero retained effects and the exact saved target-control value with LOCK; prove MPU against protected captures; then restore linker-known g_pfnVectors, execute barriers and prove VTOR readback. Only then does the assembly bridge restore CPU state and return. Permanent busy stays in the RAM drain loop. Unproved capture, cleanup or return conditions enter the nonreturning RAM terminal, without implying automatic reset or watchdog service."

msgid "目标依据：[RAM 维护目标合同](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md)、 [Arch 合同](../../design/arch-contracts.md)、 [当前软件与物理资格边界](../../delivery/qualification.md)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT <h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.dot>`。选定显式操作数及汇编协议的软件证明 受合同中的编译器、调用者与所有权前提约束；IO-24 原始完整退出、候选资格及物理 station 证据仍开放。"
msgstr "Target basis: [RAM maintenance target contract](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md), [Arch contract](../../design/arch-contracts.md), and [current software and physical qualification boundaries](../../delivery/qualification.md). {download}`Editable DOT <h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.dot>`. The software proof of selected explicit operands and assembly protocol depends on the contract's compiler, caller and ownership preconditions. The original complete IO-24 exit, candidate qualification and physical-station evidence remain open."

