msgid "FIG-21 Native RTC/LPTIM 装配、借用与重新开放"
msgstr "FIG-21 Native RTC/LPTIM assembly, loans and reopen"

msgid "**身份：current；虚线硬件分支为 target。范围：所选 Native 日历／有限计数实例， 普通 TOML 经现有 IR／provider／factory／Platform 装配，显式生命周期与真实排空。**"
msgstr "**Identity: current; the dashed hardware branch is target. Scope: selected Native calendar/finite-counter instances, ordinary TOML through existing IR/provider/factory/Platform, explicit lifecycle and actual withdrawal.**"

msgid "![Native RTC/LPTIM 的构建期装配、运行调用、最终访问和私有重新开放](rtc-lptim-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![Native RTC/LPTIM build-time assembly, runtime calls, final access and private reopen](rtc-lptim-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "Native RTC/LPTIM 的构建期装配、运行调用、最终访问和私有重新开放"
msgstr "Native RTC/LPTIM build-time assembly, runtime calls, final access and private reopen"

msgid "构建边、运行调用和请求源推进均有独立标签。factory 只返回已有接口面；生成的 Platform 首次准备构造一次，后续对已构造 owner 调用私有 start。stop 先关闭准入， 撤源失败仍保留请求和 owner；私有 start 优先拒绝保留责任。真实撤源并完成外部 join 后，重新开放先推进代次再开放准入，保留日历、速率、时钟与外部故障。模型推进不 发布请求结果。虚线硬件适配需要独立 SoC／时钟／备份域／IRQ／STOP／VBAT 合同， 不表示已有物理驱动或 HIL 通过。"
msgstr "Build edges, runtime calls and source progression have distinct labels. Factory only returns existing faces; generated Platform first constructs once and later calls private start on a constructed owner. Stop first closes admission; failed withdrawal retains request and owner, and private start gives retained responsibility priority. After actual withdrawal and external joins, reopen advances generation before opening admission and preserves calendar, rate, clock and external fault. Model progression does not publish requests. Dashed hardware adaptation needs separate SoC/clock/backup-domain/IRQ/STOP/VBAT contracts and does not establish a physical driver or HIL pass."

msgid "依据：[RTC/LPTIM 说明](../../explanation/rtc-lptim.md)、 [公共 RTC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/rtc.h)、 [公共 LPTIM](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/lptim.h)、 [Native 实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/native/rtc_lptim.c)、 [Native 装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/native/bindings.py)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT <rtc-lptim-lifecycle.dot>`；实施关联：IO-36。软件开发证据与 main／SDK／ 候选／实板资格分别判断，不能从该图或渲染成功推断。"
msgstr "Basis: [RTC/LPTIM explanation](../../explanation/rtc-lptim.md), [public RTC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/rtc.h), [public LPTIM](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/lptim.h), [Native implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/native/rtc_lptim.c), [Native assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/native/bindings.py). {download}`Editable DOT <rtc-lptim-lifecycle.dot>`; implementation link: IO-36. Assess development software evidence separately from main/SDK/candidate/hardware qualification; neither this diagram nor successful rendering establishes those results."

msgid "FIG-22 G474 命名 GPIO 状态与保留租约"
msgstr "FIG-22 G474 named GPIO states and retained lease"

msgid "**身份：current。范围：STM32G474RET6／GPIOA／baremetal／hse24-pll170 的显式 DEFAULT／SLEEP；软件 Board PA5，不表示物理安全或低功耗资格。**"
