msgid "![FIG-22：冷态 pad/gate 租约、显式目标读回、provider 撤驱动与 Platform 原快照恢复分开；失败保留责任](gpio-pin-states.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-22: cold pad/gate lease and explicit target readback; provider driver withdrawal is separate from Platform restoration of the original snapshot; failure retains responsibility](gpio-pin-states.svg)"

msgid "FIG-22：冷态 pad/gate 租约、显式目标读回、provider 撤驱动与 Platform 原快照恢复分开；失败保留责任"
msgstr "FIG-22: cold pad/gate lease and explicit target readback; provider driver withdrawal is separate from Platform restoration of the original snapshot; failure retains responsibility"

msgid "构建箭头只表示 Board/TOML 到不可变计划与静态对象的生成；factory 箭头只返回既有 face。运行选择不转让 pad 所有权。失败可能保留部分寄存器效果；重试目标或检查 stop 不能丢弃 lease。provider stop 成功后，Platform 仍须独立证明冷快照与 gate 清理；失败继续保留。图不表达 AF、wake、retention、深睡或实板结果。"
msgstr "Build arrows represent only generation from Board/TOML into immutable plans and static objects; factory arrows only return the existing face. Runtime selection does not transfer pad ownership. Failure can retain partial register effects; target retries or checked stop must not discard the lease. After provider stop succeeds, the Platform must still independently prove cold-snapshot restoration and gate cleanup; unfinished responsibilities remain retained on failure. The figure does not express AF, wake, retention, deep sleep or physical-board results."

msgid "依据：[GPIO pin-state 说明](../../explanation/gpio-pin-states.md)、[公共接口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pin_state.h)、[G474 provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/drivers/pin_state.c)、[冷态租约生成](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT <gpio-pin-states.dot>`；实施关联：IO-31。"
msgstr "References: [GPIO pin-state explanation](../../explanation/gpio-pin-states.md), [public interface](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pin_state.h), [G474 provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/drivers/pin_state.c), and [cold-lease generation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/gpio_phase.py). {download}`editable DOT <gpio-pin-states.dot>`; implementation work package: IO-31."

msgid "FIG-28 U575 LPTIM1 单 tuple 与 Stop2 有序退出"
msgstr "FIG-28 U575 LPTIM1 single tuple and ordered Stop2 exit"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：STM32U575ZIT6Q／TZEN0／baremetal／SRAM4／LPDMA1 channel0；仅一组固定 LPTIM1 CCR1／RCR0／ARR tuple，内部输出未路由。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: STM32U575ZIT6Q / TZEN0 / baremetal / SRAM4 / LPDMA1 channel0; exactly one fixed LPTIM1 CCR1 / RCR0 / ARR tuple, with no routed output.**"

msgid "成功所需的三个新鲜 write-OK 须在任何 DIER 撤源写入之前锁存；后续不依赖标志存活。有限 DMA 完成但确认缺失时，首轮保留生产源与借用并锁存 IO；下一次 service／recover 带入该失败再撤源，晚到 TC 不会升级成功。该软件参考已通过有针对性的 RED／GREEN 模型与选定 M33 开发重链接；渲染与翻译检查不建立候选或物理资格。"
msgstr "All three fresh write-OK acknowledgements required for success are latched before any DIER withdrawal write; later flag survival is not assumed. If finite DMA completes without those receipts, the first attempt retains producer and loan and latches IO. The next service/recover carries that failure before withdrawal; late TC cannot upgrade the error to success. This software reference passed focused RED/GREEN models and a selected M33 development relink; rendering and translation checks establish no candidate or physical qualification."

msgid "![FIG-28：启动账本与活动借用分开；成功 write-OK、撤源、DMA 最终访问、外设复位和全部恢复后才最终 SETTLED](u575-lptim1-lpbam.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-28: separate start ledger and active loan; success write-OK, producer withdrawal, DMA final access, peripheral reset and all restoration precede final SETTLED](u575-lptim1-lpbam.svg)"

msgid "FIG-28：启动账本与活动借用分开；成功 write-OK、撤源、DMA 最终访问、外设复位和全部恢复后才最终 SETTLED"
msgstr "FIG-28: separate start ledger and active loan; success write-OK, producer withdrawal, DMA final access, peripheral reset and all restoration precede final SETTLED"

msgid "实线标明必要顺序或分支，虚线标明保留责任与恢复。纯初始化之后显式公共 start 取得冷态独占 LPTIM1 的 gate、LSE mux 与按需 LSESYS；部分失败的启动账本保留至公共 stop 证明恢复。新 ARM owner 为 104 B，其中新增 16 B 账本；原 SRAM4 copy owner 仍为 88 B。"
msgstr "Solid arrows mark required order or branches; dashed arrows mark retained responsibility and recovery. After pure initialization, explicit public start acquires the cold, exclusive LPTIM1 gate, LSE mux and only the needed LSESYS access. A partial start failure retains its ledger until public stop proves restoration. The new ARM owner is 104 B, including a 16 B added ledger; the original SRAM4 copy owner remains 88 B."

msgid "ACCEPTED 借用 request、12 B tuple 与完整 48 B LLI 工作区。ENABLE 后至少再过两个保留 RTC tick；初始新鲜写 OK 先证明再清旗。硬件请求 13／BREQ1／保留位 DREQ0 写 CCR1，两个 SWREQ continuation LLI 依次写 RCR0、最后写 ARR；成功还须三个新鲜 write-OK。没有重复 tuple 模式；RUN LPTIM2 须预先关闭并 join。"
msgstr "ACCEPTED borrows the request, the 12 B tuple and the complete 48 B LLI workspace. At least two additional retained RTC ticks follow ENABLE; fresh bootstrap write-OK flags are proved and then cleared. Hardware request 13 / BREQ1 / reserved DREQ0 writes CCR1; two SWREQ continuation LLIs write RCR0 and then ARR last. Success also requires all three fresh write-OK flags. There is no repeated-tuple mode; RUN LPTIM2 must already be disabled and joined."

msgid "cancel／deadline 不撤销存储。UEDE0／DIEROK 证明先于 DMA suspend／reset／idle 及引用撤除；随后通过自有 RCC reset 关闭 LPTIM1，绝不清 ENABLE。全部 RTC／IRQ／loan gate／电源／时钟与引用恢复后才最终 SETTLED；acquire 观察与外部 observer join 后，joined 公共 stop 另行归还启动 access claims。未知 profile 禁止 RTC／DMA／LPTIM MMIO；recover 不再 WFI。自有 reset 仅在 DMA 最终访问证明后可重试；活动借用期间观察到的外部 reset 永久隔离，安静默认值不能证明 join。"
msgstr "Cancel and deadline do not revoke storage. UEDE0 / DIEROK proof precedes DMA suspend / reset / idle and reference withdrawal. Owned RCC reset then shuts down LPTIM1 without clearing ENABLE. Only complete restoration of RTC, IRQ, loan gates, power, clocks and references permits final SETTLED. After acquire observation and external observer joins, joined public stop separately returns the start access claims. An unknown profile forbids RTC / DMA / LPTIM MMIO; recover never executes another WFI. Owned reset can be retried only after DMA final-access proof. External reset observed during an active loan permanently quarantines it; quiet defaults cannot prove a join."

msgid "依据：[单 tuple 参考合同](../../design/u575-lptim1-lpbam.md)、[公共 receiver](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_lpdma_lptim1/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_lpdma_lptim1.h)、[公共 Stop2 face](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2_lptim1.h)、[私有 LPTIM1 profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/private/stm32u575_lptim1_profile.h)。{download}`可编辑 DOT <u575-lptim1-lpbam.dot>`；实施关联：IO-32／SOC-35。图不表示引脚路由、完整 PWM 周期播放或物理／HIL 执行；原完整退出条件仍开放。"
msgstr "Basis: [single-tuple reference contract](../../design/u575-lptim1-lpbam.md), [public receiver](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_lpdma_lptim1/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_lpdma_lptim1.h), [public Stop2 face](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2_lptim1.h), and [private LPTIM1 profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/private/stm32u575_lptim1_profile.h). {download}`Editable DOT <u575-lptim1-lpbam.dot>`; implementation links: IO-32 / SOC-35. The diagram establishes no pin route, complete PWM-period playback or physical / HIL execution; the original complete exit conditions remain open."

msgid "FIG-29 U575 MPU-v2 单任务 scalar GPIO WRITE authority"
msgstr "FIG-29 U575 MPU-v2 single-task scalar GPIO WRITE authority"

msgid "**身份：reference。范围：STM32U575ZIT6Q／TZEN0／MSIS4／CM33 MPU-v2／八个 MPU region；单任务、只读固定 PC7 WRITE grant。**"
msgstr "**Identity: reference. Scope: STM32U575ZIT6Q / TZEN0 / MSIS4 / CM33 MPU-v2 / eight MPU regions; one task and one readonly fixed PC7 WRITE grant.**"

msgid "![FIG-29：真实 SVC70、可信 current TCB 与只读绑定、掩码边界内一次 BSRR；close／join 后才删除任务](u575-mpu-gpio.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-29: real SVC70, trusted current TCB and readonly binding, one BSRR under the mask boundary; close/join before task deletion](u575-mpu-gpio.svg)"

msgid "FIG-29：真实 SVC70、可信 current TCB 与只读绑定、掩码边界内一次 BSRR；close／join 后才删除任务"
msgstr "FIG-29: real SVC70, trusted current TCB and readonly binding, one BSRR under the mask boundary; close/join before task deletion"

msgid "五个显式 normal memory region 保护普通代码、provider、TCB 与 authority；只有窄 syscall region 和显式 user text 可由 user 执行，外设 MMIO 不映射给 user。真实 reset 路径在核对完整范围后初始化 user DATA/BSS。维护的 selected 静态 ELF gate 核对三个 Nexus user 入口、真实 veneer 与完整 privileged helper/provider 指令范围；受支持的 GNU Os 启动形状之外一律拒绝。"
msgstr "Five explicit normal memory regions protect ordinary code, providers, TCB and authority; only the narrow syscall region and explicit user text permit user execution, and peripheral MMIO is not mapped to user. The real reset path initializes user DATA/BSS after checking complete bounds. The maintained selected static ELF gate checks three Nexus user entries, real veneers and complete privileged helper/provider instruction extents; unsupported GNU Os startup shapes fail closed."

msgid "实线标记实际调用、权限核验或返回，虚线标记唯一 privileged owner 的装配与生命周期职责。open 绑定实际 static TCB 与单调 epoch 并阻止删除；scalar 调用只在最终 guard 中核对仍有效的 task、device 与 PC7 mask 后执行一次 BSRR。未知 device／越权 mask／错误 task、两 mask 均为零或 set/reset 重叠、closed／陈旧代次与错误上下文均无 GPIO 效果；无 registry、worker、指针传参或异步 request。"
msgstr "Solid lines mark actual calls, permission checks or returns; dashed lines mark assembly and lifecycle responsibilities of the sole privileged owner. Open binds the actual static TCB and monotonic epoch and pins deletion. A scalar call performs one BSRR only after the final guard rechecks the live task, device and PC7 mask. Unknown devices, masks outside the grant, wrong tasks, both masks zero or set/reset overlap, closed/stale incarnations and bad contexts have no GPIO effect; there is no registry, worker, pointer argument or asynchronous request."

msgid "close 撤回准入，join 在同一单核掩码排除边界解除 pin；随后由外部 owner 删除另一任务。closing marker 覆盖实际 kernel delete，task epoch 不复位，溢出拒绝。图不代替产品的 user quiescence、栈寿命、scheduler、安全输出或 provider stop 责任。"
msgstr "Close withdraws admission and join removes the pin under the same single-core mask exclusion; the external owner then deletes the other task. A closing marker covers actual kernel deletion; task epochs never reset and overflow rejects. The figure does not replace product duties for user quiescence, stack lifetime, scheduler, safe outputs or provider stop."

msgid "依据：[精确实施合同](../../design/u575-mpu-gpio.md)、[公共 authority](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/include/nexus/os/freertos_mpu_gpio.h)、[派发与生命周期](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/mpu/gpio.c)、[真实 GPIO provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/drivers/gpio.c)、[normal memory generator](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/memory.py)。{download}`可编辑 DOT <u575-mpu-gpio.dot>`。维护的 Native host 模型、normal M33 reset 链接及单个搬移 development SDK consumer 已实际通过；[源码绑定证据](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/evidence/u575-mpu-gpio-20261020/README.md) 分开记录阶段、ABI 与资源。软件模型及静态 layout／opcode／selected 入口及受支持 startup 调用目标 不证明真实 MPU 隔离或物理 HIL，也不建立 M7、完整 SDK plan 或 IO-39／SOC-36 原退出资格。"
msgstr "Sources: [exact implementation contract](../../design/u575-mpu-gpio.md), [public authority](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/include/nexus/os/freertos_mpu_gpio.h), [dispatch/lifecycle](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/mpu/gpio.c), [real GPIO provider](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/drivers/gpio.c), [normal memory generator](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/memory.py). {download}`Editable DOT <u575-mpu-gpio.dot>`. Maintained Native host models, the normal M33 reset link and one relocated development-SDK consumer passed actual execution; [source-bound evidence](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/evidence/u575-mpu-gpio-20261020/README.md) separates phases, ABI and resources. Software models and static layout/opcode/selected-entry and supported-startup call targets do not prove runtime MPU isolation or physical HIL, nor M7, the complete SDK plan or original IO-39/SOC-36 exit criteria."
